---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
const features = [
 ['01', 'Your equipment. In one place.', 'Keep machinery, vehicles and tools in a clear equipment register, with locations, details and notes. Find the item you need without hunting through spreadsheets.'],
 ['02', 'Checks that keep coming back.', 'Set daily, weekly, monthly or custom date-based schedules. Add equipment checklists so staff know exactly what to check and record when the work is complete.'],
 ['03', 'Faults worth following up.', 'Report a problem against the equipment. Track its severity and status, then record the resolution so the next shift knows where things stand.'],
 ['04', 'A record you can look back on.', 'Review maintenance completion history and faults. Records automatically show the person who completed the work or reported the problem.'],
 ['05', 'A PIN for every person.', 'Give people a simple personal PIN. Admins manage equipment, schedules and people; Staff complete maintenance and report faults. Unlimited people, with no per-user charge.'],
 ['06', 'From desk to workshop floor.', 'Run Maintainr on the main PC. Phones, tablets and laptops use a browser on the same local Wi-Fi or LAN. Staff devices need no app installation or extra licence.'],
];
const faqs = [
 ['Is this a subscription?', 'No. Maintainr V1 costs £79 once for one Maintainr server installation. It includes unlimited equipment, unlimited staff and all Maintainr 1.x updates.'],
 ['Where is my data stored?', 'On your main Maintainr PC, in a local SQLite database. You control that computer and its backups. No cloud account is required for normal use.'],
 ['Do staff need to install anything?', 'No. Staff open Maintainr in a browser on a phone, tablet or laptop connected to the same local network as the main PC.'],
 ['Does each employee require a licence?', 'No. One licence covers one active Maintainr server installation. Unlimited staff and personal PIN users are included. Staff client devices do not consume licences.'],
 ['Does Maintainr work without internet?', 'Yes. Normal use happens on your local network. Paid activation needs an internet connection once; after activation, Maintainr verifies its licence locally and continues working offline.'],
 ['What happens at the 10-equipment trial limit?', 'You can keep using the existing equipment, checklists, schedules, faults and history. Adding more than 10 active equipment items prompts you to upgrade. Purchase and activate a licence to remove the equipment limit.'],
 ['Can I move my licence to another PC?', 'Yes. An admin can deactivate the old server before activating the licence on another PC. One licence allows one active server installation at a time. Move or back up your maintenance data separately.'],
 ['Does the main PC need to stay on?', 'Yes. It hosts Maintainr and the local database, so it must be running and connected to the local network while other devices use it.'],
];
const schema = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'SoftwareApplication',name:'Maintainr',applicationCategory:'BusinessApplication',operatingSystem:'Windows',url:site.url,description:'Simple, local-first maintenance tracking for small businesses.',publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'StackedThink',url:'https://stackedthink.com'},offers:{'@type':'Offer',price:'79.00',priceCurrency:'GBP',url:site.checkout,description:'One-time licence for one Maintainr server installation, including all 1.x updates.'}};
---
<Layout title="Maintainr | Maintenance tracking software for small businesses" description="Maintenance tracking without the enterprise software. Equipment, checklists, faults and history on your local network. £79 once, unlimited staff.">
<script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div>
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="red-square"></span> BUILT FOR THE WORKSHOP. RUNS ON YOUR NETWORK.</p>
  <h1>Maintenance tracking<br />without the<br /><em>enterprise software.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead">Meet Maintainr. Simple, local-first maintenance tracking for small businesses. Know what needs doing, what’s overdue and what’s already been done.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/download/">{site.windowsDownload ? 'Download Trial' : 'Windows download coming soon'} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="button secondary" href={site.checkout}>Buy Maintainr · £79 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <p class="fine">One-time purchase. Unlimited staff. Your data stays local.</p>
</div><aside class="hero-spec" aria-label="Maintainr product summary"><div class="spec-head"><span>MAINTAINR / V1</span><span>LOCAL FIRST</span></div><div class="spec-title">Less admin.<br />More done.</div><p>For the machines, vehicles and equipment your business depends on.</p><dl><div><dt>TRACK</dt><dd>Equipment &amp; maintenance</dd></div><div><dt>RECORD</dt><dd>Checks, faults &amp; history</dd></div><div><dt>CONNECT</dt><dd>Your PC + your local network</dd></div><div><dt>OWN</dt><dd>Your data. Your installation.</dd></div></dl><div class="spec-foot"><b>£79</b><span>ONE-TIME<br />NO SUBSCRIPTION</span></div></aside></div></section>
<div class="industry-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>AT HOME IN</span><p>Workshops / Manufacturing / Garages / Fabrication / Facilities / Farms / Small fleets</p></div></div>
<section id="features" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE EVERYDAY ESSENTIALS</p><h2>Get maintenance<br />off the whiteboard.</h2></div><p>A practical CMMS alternative for small businesses moving on from Excel and paper checklists. The tools you need to keep track, without a lengthy implementation project.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">{features.map(([n,title,body]) => <article class="feature"><span class="number">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section id="how-it-works" class="local-section"><div class="wrap local-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / YOUR WORKSHOP. YOUR NETWORK.</p><h2>One main PC.<br />The whole team connected.</h2><p class="lead">Maintainr and your maintenance data live on your main PC. Everyone else connects through a browser on your local network.</p><ul class="plain-list"><li>Local SQLite storage under your control</li><li>No cloud account required for everyday use</li><li>Internet needed once for paid activation</li><li>Staff phones, tablets and laptops included</li></ul><p class="fine">Designed for your trusted local business network. Keep the main PC running when staff need access, and make regular backups of your data.</p></div><figure class="network"><div class="host"><span class="device-icon" aria-hidden="true">▣</span><strong>MAIN WORKSHOP PC</strong><span>Maintainr + local database</span></div><div class="network-line"><span>LOCAL WI-FI / LAN</span></div><div class="clients"><div><span aria-hidden="true">▯</span><strong>PHONE</strong></div><div><span aria-hidden="true">▯</span><strong>TABLET</strong></div><div><span aria-hidden="true">▱</span><strong>LAPTOP</strong></div></div><figcaption>One installation. Other devices use a browser.<br />Your maintenance records stay on the main PC.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section id="pricing" class="section wrap pricing-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / STRAIGHTFORWARD PRICING</p><h2>Buy it once.<br />Get on with the job.</h2><p class="lead">No subscription. No per-user pricing.<br />One licence for one Maintainr server installation.</p><div class="trial-box"><h3>Test it with your own equipment.</h3><p>The full working trial supports <strong>10 active equipment items</strong>, unlimited people and PINs, unlimited checklist items and maintenance schedules, and unlimited faults and history.</p><a class="text-link" href="/download/">Windows download &amp; getting started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><article class="price-card"><p class="eyebrow">MAINTAINR V1</p><div class="price">£79 <span>one-time</span></div><ul class="ticks"><li>Unlimited equipment after purchase</li><li>Unlimited staff and PIN users</li><li>All Maintainr 1.x updates</li><li>No subscription</li><li>Local-first data</li></ul><a class="button primary" href={site.checkout}>Buy Maintainr · £79 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="fine">One active server installation per licence.<br />Staff devices do not consume licences.</p><a class="text-link" href="/licence-help/">Already purchased? Activate your licence →</a></article></section>
<section id="faq" class="faq-section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / BEFORE YOU GET STARTED</p><h2>Practical questions.<br />Clear answers.</h2></div><div>{faqs.map(([q,a]) => <details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE ORDER ON THE WORKSHOP FLOOR.</p><h2>Make the next check easier.</h2></div><a class="button secondary" href="/download/">Explore the trial &amp; setup <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</Layout>
